    "text_excerpt": "Custom Boxes Printed Cheap & Delivered Fast @PackagingDaddy.com\nHOME\nBOXES BY STYLE\nDOWNLOAD TEMPLATES\nCONTACT\nMore\nRegister\nLogin\nSearch\nFree Box Styles\nSamples\nSo Whats New\nWe Introduced First Free Packaging Boxes Template Download Facility for you. Enjoy!\nChoose Shape, Set Size, Download Template, Input Your Design in Template, Upload Back In Our Website > View Instant 3D View > Calculate Live Prices > Place Order > We Send You Pre Press Digital Proof as PDF > You Approve > We Start Production > You Will Get updates until Delivery.\nLearn More\nBox Recommendation\nWe recommend some typical and common boxes for you\nTuck Box\nStart\nGift Box\nStart\nDisplay Box\nStart\nLock Bottom Box\nStart\nDrawer Style Box\nStart\nPillow Box\nStart\nMore Than Just Packaging\nLove is love is love! In 2012, we followed \nCustom Boxes Printed Cheap & Delivered Fast @PackagingDaddy.com\nHOME\nBOXES BY STYLE\nDOWNLOAD TEMPLATES\nCONTACT\nMore\nRegister\nLogin\nSearch\nFree Box Styles\nSamples\nSo Whats New\nWe Introduced First Free Packaging Boxes Template Download Facility for you. Enjoy!\nChoose Shape, Set Size, Download Template, Input Your Design in Template, Upload Back In Our Website > View Instant 3D View > Calculate Live Prices > Place Order > We Send You Pre Press Digital Proof as PDF > You Approve > We Start Production > You Will Get updates until Delivery.\nLearn More\nBox Recommendation\nWe recommend some typical and common boxes for you\nTuck Box\nStart\nGift Box\nStart\nDisplay Box\nStart\nLock Bottom Box\nStart\nDrawer Style Box\nStart\nPillow Box\nStart\nMore Than Just Packaging\nLove is love is love! In 2012, we followed our passion for retail to do something that had never been done before. Five years later, we’ve reinvented ourselves over (and over) again. Over 1000 Templates, Free 3D View of your Packaging Boxes, Free Templates and Live Prices.\nBeautiful designs, powerful features, and the freedom to build anything you want. Packaging Daddy is both Free and Priceless at the same time.\n59% of the Product Inventors struggle choosing Packaging suppliers. We sent everything to your Table.\nManage Orders Online, Reorder with 1 Click for the same specs of your previous order, stay informed every step of the way\nOver 60 Thousand people have chosen Packaging Daddy to power the Product Sale — join the family\nUser's Guide\nTutorial\nPrinting Process\nPrinting Material\nPrinting notes\nContact Us\nOrder Notice\nAbout Color Difference\nAbout transportation\nAfter-sale service\nReturn Policy\nCustom Boxes\n|"
